## Do / don't
- Do not call this product `ja-cms` / `JA-CMS` in new user-facing copy.
- Do not re-add Content/Layout/Publishing/themes to `main` unless explicitly building a downstream product line.
- Do not mark work `done` without verify evidence and task brief § Hasil (scale M+).
- Prefer minimal diffs; run `npm run agent:verify` (or CI gates) before calling work done.
- Never commit secrets / `.env`.
- Keep per-module `README.md` + `CHANGELOG.md` updated (see `.cursor/rules/module-documentation.mdc`).
